Swipe Harvest is a full screen, client side web game made with HTML, CSS, and JavaScript.
Swipe fruit with touch, pen, or mouse; arrow keys plus Space provide a keyboard blade.
A 25 challenge campaign crosses five gardens, with combos, flow bonuses, golden fruit,
Harvest Rush, ceramic hazards, and constellation orbits. Quick Play, Zen, Daily Harvest,
and Survival provide replay modes. Art and sound are generated locally. Saves use
localStorage with import/export and graceful fallback. There is no backend or offline
installation layer. See README.md for controls, architecture, and code-only tests.
